    "long_description":  "MachineSignal helps automated systems decide whether a business domain deserves more analysis, enrichment or CRM action. The API returns score, confidence, decision, spend policy and next machine action. If the machine has no list, it can buy Target Discovery. If a score is strong, it can buy Deep Analysis as a spend-control gate. Only after Deep Analysis confirms the action gate should the machine buy Action Pack, which returns CRM-ready JSON and workflow payloads. A machine can create a limited sandbox key and test the flow without a human sales conversation. Latest bounded beta evidence confirms the machine-buyer path: 5 scores, 1 Deep Analysis and 1 gated Action Pack, with Action Pack blocked when no Deep Analysis source order is supplied.",
